Regional resilience is not a simple matter of moving a purchasing contract across borders. The same nominal node may differ in libraries, device options and qualification history between facilities. For procurement teams, a more useful question is which designs can be manufactured at more than one approved site and what engineering work would be required to establish an alternative.

